@* 🟢 خطة 05 بند 25: طباعة ملصقات الباركود (بدل PrintBarCodeForOneItems «طباعة البار كود الصنف»، PrintBarCodeForOneItemsWithPrice
   «مع السعر»، Bill_PrintItemsBarCodeItemsList «قائمة الأصناف»). قائمة أصناف بعدد نسخ لكل صنف: إضافة بالبحث، أو تحميل أصناف مخزن/فئة
   (النسخ = 1 أو = الرصيد بالوحدة الكبرى). الملصق: الاسم (عربى/الفاتورة/إنجليزى أو بلا)، الباركود، الكود، والسعر اختيارياً.
   مقاس الملصق والتباعد والهوامش من الإعداد المحفوظ فى «إعدادات طباعة الباركود» (BarCodeSettingCLS.GetCurrent).
   الترميز Code 128 (يقبل الحروف الصغيرة والرموز وأقصر من Code 39 لنفس الكود — المعتاد فى الأنظمة الحديثة).
   التصميم حسب ui-ux-pro-max ونظام inv-* المشترك. *@
@page "/items/barcode-labels"

@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountModelsLib.Models
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Components.Shared
@using ZXing
@using static AccountModelsLib.BarcodeLabelsService
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject IJSRuntime JS
@inject ISnackbar Snackbar
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@Tr("BLTitle")</PageTitle>

<InvoiceStyles />

<style>
    .bl-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 20px; }
    .bl-head .ico { flex: none; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 16px; display: grid; place-items: center;
                    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 14%, transparent); color: var(--mud-palette-primary); }
    .bl-head .ico .mud-icon-root { font-size: 2rem; }
    .bl-head .titles { flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; }
    .bl-head .sub { margin-top: 4px; font-size: .875rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .bl-head .mud-button-root { min-height: 44px; }
    .bl-gap { margin-top: 16px; }
    .bl-cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
    .bl-load { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; align-items: start; }
    .bl-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 16px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .bl-opts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; align-items: start; }
    .bl-line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 120px 44px; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-lines-default); }
    .bl-line .nm { font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .bl-line .cd { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .bl-line .bad { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--mud-palette-error); }
    .bl-empty { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 32px 12px; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); text-align: center; }
    .bl-empty .mud-icon-root { opacity: .5; }
    .bl-preview { overflow: auto; max-height: 70vh; padding: 8px; background: var(--mud-palette-background-gray); border-radius: 12px; }
    .bl-sheet { display: grid; justify-content: start; }
    .bl-label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden;
                background: #fff; color: #000; border: 1px dashed #bbb; font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center; }
    .bl-label .n { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; }
    .bl-label img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
    .bl-label .c { font-size: 9px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: .5px; }
    .bl-label .p { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .bl-more { margin-top: 8px; font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    @@media (max-width: 1199px) { .bl-cols { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
    @@media (max-width: 599px) { .bl-load, .bl-opts { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .bl-line { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 96px 44px; } }
    @@media print {
        body * { visibility: hidden; }
        .bl-print, .bl-print * { visibility: visible; }
        .bl-print { position: absolute; inset-inline-start: 0; top: 0; }
        .bl-preview { max-height: none; overflow: visible; background: none; padding: 0; }
        .bl-label { border: none; }
        .bl-noprint { display: none !important; }
    }
</style>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">
<div class="inv-page">

    <div class="inv-card bl-head">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.QrCode2" /></div>
        <div class="titles">
            <h1 class="inv-title">@Tr("BLTitle")</h1>
            <div class="sub">@Tr("BLSub", _lines.Count, TotalLabels)</div>
        </div>
        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Tune" Href="/main-data/barcode-print-settings">@Tr("BLLayoutSettings")</MudButton>
        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Print" Disabled="@(TotalLabels == 0)" OnClick="PrintAsync">@Tr("BLPrint", TotalLabels)</MudButton>
    </div>

    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_error))
    {
        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" Class="mt-3" role="alert">@_error</MudAlert>
    }

    <div class="bl-cols bl-gap">
        <div>
            <div class="inv-card">
                <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.AddCircleOutline" />@Tr("BLAddItems")</h2>
                <MudAutocomplete T="LabelItem" Label="@Tr("BLSearchItem")" Value="_pick" ValueChanged="AddPickedAsync" SearchFunc="SearchAsync"
                                 ToStringFunc="@(i => i == null ? null : $"{i.Code} - {i.Item_Name}")" DebounceInterval="300" MinCharacters="1"
                                 Clearable="true" ResetValueOnEmptyText="true" Variant="Variant.Outlined" FullWidth="true"
                                 Adornment="Adornment.Start" AdornmentIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search" HelperText="@Tr("BLSearchHint")" />

                <MudDivider Class="my-4" />
                <h3 class="inv-card-title" style="font-size:1rem"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Inventory2" />@Tr("BLLoadTitle")</h3>
                <div class="bl-load">
                    <MudSelect T="long" @bind-Value="_storeId" Label="@Tr("SOParty_4")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                               ToStringFunc="@(v => v == 0 ? Tr("SBAll") : _stores.FirstOrDefault(s => s.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                        <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="0L">@Tr("SBAll")</MudSelectItem>
                        @foreach (var s in _stores) { <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@s.Id">@s.Name</MudSelectItem> }
                    </MudSelect>
                    <MudSelect T="long" @bind-Value="_categoryId" Label="@Tr("SBCategory")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                               ToStringFunc="@(v => v == 0 ? Tr("SBAll") : _categories.FirstOrDefault(c => c.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                        <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="0L">@Tr("SBAll")</MudSelectItem>
                        @foreach (var c in _categories) { <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@c.Id">@c.Name</MudSelectItem> }
                    </MudSelect>
                </div>
                <div class="bl-row">
                    <MudSwitch T="bool" @bind-Value="_onlyInStock" Color="Color.Primary" Label="@Tr("BLOnlyInStock")" />
                    <MudSwitch T="bool" @bind-Value="_copiesFromBalance" Color="Color.Primary" Label="@Tr("BLCopiesFromBalance")" />
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" Disabled="_loadingItems" OnClick="LoadItemsAsync"
                               StartIcon="@(_loadingItems ? null : Icons.Material.Filled.PlaylistAdd)">
                        @if (_loadingItems) { <MudProgressCircular Size="Size.Small" Indeterminate="true" Class="me-2" /> }
                        @Tr("BLLoadButton")
                    </MudButton>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="inv-card bl-gap">
                <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Tune" />@Tr("BLOptions")</h2>
                <div class="bl-opts">
                    <MudSelect T="string" @bind-Value="_nameSource" Label="@Tr("BLNameShown")" Variant="Variant.Outlined">
                        <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("name")">@Tr("BLName_name")</MudSelectItem>
                        <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("invoice")">@Tr("BLName_invoice")</MudSelectItem>
                        <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("english")">@Tr("BLName_english")</MudSelectItem>
                        <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("none")">@Tr("BLName_none")</MudSelectItem>
                    </MudSelect>
                    <MudSelect T="string" Value="_codeSource" ValueChanged="OnCodeSourceChanged" Label="@Tr("BLCodeShown")" Variant="Variant.Outlined">
                        <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("code")">@Tr("BLCode_code")</MudSelectItem>
                        <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("barcode2")">@Tr("BLCode_barcode2")</MudSelectItem>
                        <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("barcode3")">@Tr("BLCode_barcode3")</MudSelectItem>
                    </MudSelect>
                    <MudNumericField T="int" @bind-Value="_columns" Label="@Tr("BarcodeColumnsCount")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Min="1" Max="10" />
                </div>
                <div class="bl-row">
                    <MudSwitch T="bool" @bind-Value="_showPrice" Color="Color.Primary" Label="@Tr("BLShowPrice")" />
                    <MudSwitch T="bool" @bind-Value="_showCode" Color="Color.Primary" Label="@Tr("BLShowCode")" />
                </div>
                <div class="bl-more">@Tr("BLLayoutNote", Num(_w), Num(_h))</div>
            </div>

            <div class="inv-card bl-gap">
                <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ListAlt" />@Tr("BLLines")<span class="inv-count">@_lines.Count</span>
                    @if (_lines.Count > 0)
                    {
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Text" Color="Color.Error" Size="Size.Small" Class="ms-auto" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ClearAll" OnClick="ClearAll">@Tr("BLClear")</MudButton>
                    }
                </h2>
                @if (_lines.Count == 0)
                {
                    <div class="bl-empty"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.QrCodeScanner" Size="Size.Large" /><b>@Tr("BLNoLines")</b><span>@Tr("BLNoLinesHint")</span></div>
                }
                else
                {
                    @foreach (var l in _lines)
                    {
                        <div class="bl-line">
                            <div>
                                <div class="nm">@l.Item.Item_Name</div>
                                <div class="cd">@CodeOf(l.Item) · @Money(l.Item.Sale_Price)</div>
                                @if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(CodeOf(l.Item))) { <div class="bad">@Tr("BLNoCode")</div> }
                                else if (Image(CodeOf(l.Item)) == "") { <div class="bad">@Tr("BLBadCode")</div> }
                            </div>
                            <MudNumericField T="int" @bind-Value="l.Copies" Label="@Tr("BLCopies")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense" Min="0" Max="999" />
                            <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Close" aria-label="@Tr("BLRemove", l.Item.Item_Name)" OnClick="@(() => _lines.Remove(l))" />
                        </div>
                    }
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="inv-card">
            <h2 class="inv-card-title bl-noprint"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Preview" />@Tr("BarcodePreviewLabel")<span class="inv-count">@TotalLabels</span></h2>
            <div class="bl-preview bl-print">
                <div class="bl-sheet" style="@SheetStyle">
                    @foreach (var lab in Labels)
                    {
                        <div class="bl-label" style="@LabelStyle">
                            @if (_nameSource != "none" && !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(NameOf(lab))) { <div class="n">@NameOf(lab)</div> }
                            @{ var img = Image(CodeOf(lab)); }
                            @if (img != "") { <img src="@img" alt="@CodeOf(lab)" style="@BarStyle" /> }
                            @if (_showCode) { <div class="c">@CodeOf(lab)</div> }
                            @if (_showPrice) { <div class="p">@Tr("BLPriceOnLabel", Money(lab.Sale_Price))</div> }
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
                @if (_lines.Sum(l => Math.Max(0, l.Copies)) > MaxLabels) { <div class="bl-more bl-noprint">@Tr("BLPreviewCapped", MaxLabels)</div> }
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    private const int MaxLabels = 500;

    private class Line
    {
        public LabelItem Item { get; set; } = new();
        public int Copies { get; set; } = 1;
    }

    /// <summary>price=1 يفتح وطباعة السعر مفعَّلة (عنصر «مع السعر»).</summary>
    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "price")] public int? PriceQuery { get; set; }

    private readonly BarcodeLabelsService _svc = new();
    private readonly StoreBalancesService _balances = new();
    private List<StoreBalancesService.Option> _stores = new(), _categories = new();
    private readonly List<Line> _lines = new();
    private readonly Dictionary<string, string> _images = new();
    private LabelItem? _pick;
    private long _storeId, _categoryId;
    private bool _onlyInStock = true, _copiesFromBalance, _loadingItems, _showPrice, _showCode = true;
    private string _nameSource = "name", _codeSource = "code";
    private string? _error;
    private int _columns = 3;
    // مقاس الملصق (مم) من الإعداد المحفوظ؛ هذه قيم «إعدادات طباعة الباركود» الافتراضية
    private float _w = 45f, _h = 28f, _barH = 12f, _sx = 50f, _sy = 30f, _lm = 2f, _tm = 2f;

    private int TotalLabels => Math.Min(_lines.Sum(l => Math.Max(0, l.Copies)), MaxLabels);
    private IEnumerable<LabelItem> Labels => _lines.SelectMany(l => Enumerable.Repeat(l.Item, Math.Max(0, l.Copies))).Take(MaxLabels);

    private string SheetStyle => FormattableString.Invariant(
        $"grid-template-columns: repeat({Math.Clamp(_columns, 1, 10)}, {_w}mm); column-gap: {Math.Max(0, _sx - _w)}mm; row-gap: {Math.Max(0, _sy - _h)}mm;");
    private string LabelStyle => FormattableString.Invariant($"width:{_w}mm; height:{_h}mm; padding:{_tm}mm {_lm}mm;");
    private string BarStyle => FormattableString.Invariant($"height:{Math.Max(4f, Math.Min(_barH, _h - 6))}mm; width:100%;");

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged += OnLanguageChangedHandler;
        _showPrice = PriceQuery == 1;
        try
        {
            Item_BarCodeSetting? row = null;
            (_stores, _categories, row) = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                var opp = new operations();
                return (_balances.GetStores(4), _balances.GetCategories(), new BarCodeSettingCLS().GetCurrent(ref opp));
            });
            if (row != null)
            {
                _w = F(row.Width, _w); _h = F(row.Height, _h); _barH = F(row.BarCodeHeight, _barH);
                _sx = F(row.Space_X_Item, _sx); _sy = F(row.Space_Y_Item, _sy); _lm = F(row.LeftMargin, _lm); _tm = F(row.TopMargin, _tm);
                if (PriceQuery is null) _showPrice = row.IsPrintPrice == "True";
            }
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); }
    }

    private void OnLanguageChangedHandler() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    public void Dispose() => LangService.OnLanguageChanged -= OnLanguageChangedHandler;

    private async Task<IEnumerable<LabelItem>> SearchAsync(string value, CancellationToken token)
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(value)) return Array.Empty<LabelItem>();
        try { return await Task.Run(() => { AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant(); return _svc.Search(value); }, token); }
        catch { return Array.Empty<LabelItem>(); }
    }

    private Task AddPickedAsync(LabelItem? item)
    {
        if (item != null) AddLine(item, 1);
        _pick = null;
        return Task.CompletedTask;
    }

    private void AddLine(LabelItem item, int copies)
    {
        var existing = _lines.FirstOrDefault(l => l.Item.Item_Id == item.Item_Id);
        if (existing != null) existing.Copies = Math.Min(999, existing.Copies + copies);
        else _lines.Add(new Line { Item = item, Copies = copies });
    }

    private async Task LoadItemsAsync()
    {
        _loadingItems = true; _error = null;
        long s = _storeId, c = _categoryId; bool only = _onlyInStock;
        try
        {
            var items = await Task.Run(() => { AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant(); return _svc.Load(s, c, only); });
            foreach (var i in items) AddLine(i, _copiesFromBalance ? (int)Math.Clamp(Math.Ceiling(i.Balance_Large), 0, 999) : 1);
            Snackbar.Add(Tr("BLLoaded", items.Count), items.Count > 0 ? Severity.Success : Severity.Info);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); }
        finally { _loadingItems = false; }
    }

    private void ClearAll() => _lines.Clear();
    private void OnCodeSourceChanged(string v) { _codeSource = v; }

    private string CodeOf(LabelItem i) => (_codeSource switch
    {
        "barcode2" => i.BarCode2, "barcode3" => i.BarCode3, _ => i.Code,
    } ?? "").Trim();

    private string NameOf(LabelItem i) => (_nameSource switch
    {
        "invoice" => string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(i.Name_On_Invoice) ? i.Item_Name : i.Name_On_Invoice,
        "english" => string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(i.English_Name) ? i.Item_Name : i.English_Name,
        "none" => "",
        _ => i.Item_Name,
    } ?? "").Trim();

    /// <summary>صورة الباركود لكل كود مرة واحدة (Code 128)؛ "" إن تعذَّر ترميز الكود.</summary>
    private string Image(string code)
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(code)) return "";
        if (_images.TryGetValue(code, out var uri)) return uri;
        try { uri = BarcodeImageService.GeneratePngDataUri(code, BarcodeFormat.CODE_128, 360, 90); }
        catch { uri = ""; }
        _images[code] = uri;
        return uri;
    }

    private async Task PrintAsync() => await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("window.print");

    private static float F(string? s, float fallback) => float.TryParse(s, NumberStyles.Float, CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, out var v) && v > 0 ? v : fallback;
    private static string Num(float v) => v.ToString("0.#", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
    private static string Money(decimal v) => v.ToString("N2", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
    private static string Inner(Exception ex) { while (ex.InnerException != null) ex = ex.InnerException; return ex.Message; }

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key, args];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }
}
